  "notes": "The reference brand: its values are tokens/ref/*, and its brand.tokens.json declares no tokens, because prism-native layers that file first and any write would be a dead write (ADR-0020 §1). Signature preset: Onest (ui, display) and JetBrains Mono (mono) are bundled on Apple and served on the web from the same files, each with its OFL.txt beside it; the web stacks are ref.font.*, the Apple faces ref.font.apple.* (ADR-0020 §5). postscript maps each weight to the name Core Text exposes: the fvar instance name or, for the default instance, name ID 6 (JetBrainsMono-Regular); JetBrains Mono has no 600 instance. pnpm fonts:check verifies every field (ADR-0021 §11)."
